   "text": "Nottingham Trent International College - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nNottingham Trent International College - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nOver the years Nottingham Trent University has climbed the rankings to compete with institutions that have dominated the industry for decades. NTU can trace its roots back to 1843 and has won numerous awards and accolades and can boast one of the highest graduate employment rates in the country.\nFoundation students can benefit from fantastic facilities, an exciting social life and a city-center location. All of this has helped NTU maintain consistently high levels of student satisfaction. Nottingham Trent has won a number of 'University of the Year' awards in recent years. Successful completion of the foundation program will lead to guaranteed entry onto a NTU degree course.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:35\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:30\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £20,510.00\nMin: £12,512.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n11%\n3,936 of 35,785 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1843\nCampus(es)\nNottingham\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_syR6xZvsG0\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
